# Dataset

## Overview

The dataset used in this study consists of **45,211 customer-level records** obtained from banking information systems.

The dataset was used to investigate customer interaction propensity and to develop and evaluate the machine learning and deep learning models described in the study.

## Data Availability

The original customer-level dataset is not publicly included in this repository because it contains sensitive and confidential information and is subject to institutional and privacy restrictions.

Therefore, this repository does not distribute the original raw dataset.

## Authorized Use

Researchers who have authorized access to the underlying dataset can reproduce the computational workflow by placing the permitted dataset in:

```text
data/raw/
```

The preprocessing and analysis scripts provided in this repository can then be used to reproduce the subsequent computational steps.

## Data Organization

```text
data/
├── raw/
├── processed/
└── splits/
```

### `raw/`

Contains the authorized original dataset used as input to the computational pipeline. This directory is intended for local use only and should not contain publicly committed copies of confidential data.

### `processed/`

Contains processed data generated by the preprocessing pipeline.

### `splits/`

Contains predefined data partitions or cross-validation information, when applicable.

## Privacy

No personally identifiable information or confidential customer-level information should be uploaded to or committed to the public repository.

Users with authorized access to the dataset are responsible for ensuring that any local use of the data complies with applicable institutional approvals, data-use agreements, privacy requirements, and relevant data-governance policies.
